What this license covers

It covers the original work in this repository: the Toolbox host and native
port (port/), the installers and packaging scripts, the translator and other
tools (tools/, cd/lifter/, scripts/), and the documentation.

It does NOT cover:
  * "Castles: Siege & Conquest" itself. The game, its data, art, sound and
    movies belong to their owners (Interplay / MacPlay) and are not included.
  * The C files in port/gen/ and cd/ that the translator produces from the
    game's program code. They are a mechanical translation of the original
    game code and remain subject to the rights of its owners; they are
    published only so the port can be built and checked.
  * Third-party components, which keep their own licenses: the Musashi 68k
    emulator (port/musashi) and the bundled fonts (see FONTS.md).
